OL,3,GNEWSAFilmmaker performs live soundtrack
OL,4,Ato new movie
OL,5,
OL,6,FFilm director Mark Jenkin has been
OL,7,Fperforming a live soundtrack to his new
OL,8,Ffilm to "heighten the emotion" felt by
OL,9,Fthe audience as the drama unfolds.
OL,11,FJenkin's third film is the story of
OL,12,Fmissing fishing trawler Rose of Nevada,
OL,13,Fwhich mysteriously returns to a Cornish
OL,14,Fharbour. Two young men, played by
OL,15,FCallum Turner and George MacKay, join
OL,16,Fits crew unaware how their fates will
OL,17,Fchange.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
