OL,3,GNEWSAFilmmaker performs live soundtrack
OL,4,Ato new movie
OL,5,
OL,6,FJenkin has been performing the score
OL,7,Flive at theatre screenings with his
OL,8,Fmusical partner Dion Star. They use
OL,9,Fimprovised and composed pieces
OL,10,Fincluding tape machines, synths,
OL,11,Fguitars and field recordings.
OL,13,FHe said the soundtrack could change at
OL,14,Feach showing. "We react to the film
OL,15,Flive with the audience," Jenkin said.
